OUTPUT RULES:
- Return ONLY raw valid JSON. No markdown, no backticks, no text before or after.
- Never use double quotes inside any value. Use single quotes if needed.
- For line breaks inside a value, use \n (write \n\n between paragraphs).
- voiceover_script must be spoken words only: no emojis, no hashtags, no symbols, no brackets, no stage directions.

LANGUAGE RULES:
- voiceover_script: write in HINDI using Devanagari script (not English letters). Keep tech words like AI, ChatGPT, Google and app names in English letters. Use simple, friendly, spoken Hindi like a popular Indian tech YouTuber. Short sentences.
- hook, on_screen_text, scene_keywords: English / Roman letters only.
- caption: Hinglish in English letters.

VOICEOVER STRUCTURE (45 to 55 seconds, 105 to 125 words), in exactly this order:
1. Greeting: one short, warm line, like 'नमस्ते दोस्तो!'
2. Why watch: one line telling people who want to stay updated in AI why they should watch till the end.
3. News intro: one line that introduces today's story, like 'आज की खबर है ...'
4. The news: 3 to 4 short lines. Only facts from the headline. Use 'रिपोर्ट के मुताबिक' for claims. Say why it matters to Indian users.
5. One simple, safe tip: 1 to 2 lines.
6. Closing: one question to get comments, then 'रोज़ AI अपडेट के लिए फॉलो करें'.

JSON FORMAT:
{
 "ranking": "1. <headline> - <score>/10 - <one-line reason>\n2. <headline> - <score>/10 - <reason>\n3. ... up to 5",
 "why_picked": "<2 lines>",
 "chosen_story": "<headline>",
 "source_name": "<news site name>",
 "link": "<link>",
 "hook": "<one punchy line, max 12 words>",
 "voiceover_script": "<Hindi in Devanagari, 105-125 words, following the structure above>",
 "on_screen_text": ["Namaste Dosto!", "Big AI News Today", "<key point 1, max 5 words>", "<key point 2, max 5 words>", "<key point 3 or tip, max 5 words>", "Follow for daily AI updates"],
 "scene_keywords": ["<8 different English search phrases for stock visuals, in story order, e.g. server room, typing on laptop, office meeting. Generic visuals only, no brand or person names>"],
 "avatar_pose": "<one of: smiling, explaining, sad, standing>",
 "caption": "<line 1: strong hook with 1 emoji>\n\n<full story in simple Hinglish, 120-180 words, short paragraphs, only facts from the headline>\n\nSource: <news site name>\n\n<one question to get comments>\n\nFollow for daily AI updates, save and share! This reel was made with the help of AI tools.",
 "hashtags": ["#AI", "#AINews", "#AITools", "#LearnAI", "#HinglishTech", "<1 to 3 tags specific to the story>"],
 "fact_check": ["<point 1 to verify>", "<point 2 to verify>", "<optional point 3>"]
}
